<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5116" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bellātrix</span></b> , īcis,
			f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				female warrior;</i> freq. in close apposition, and taking the
			place of an adj. (cf. bellator, II.), <i>warlike</i>, <i>skilled in war</i>, <i>serviceable in war</i> (mostly <b>poet.</b>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Penthesilea,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 1, 493</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">diva,</span>”
				i. e. <i>Pallas</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Tr. 1, 5, 76</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Minerva,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. M.
					8, 264</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Roma,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Tr. 2, 321</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hispania,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Flor.
					2, 6, 38</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cohors,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 6, 262</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">belua,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the elephant</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					9, 576</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, of inanim. things: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carinae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 7, 57</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">glaeba,</span>”
				i. e. <i>producing warriors</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 7, 612</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pompa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. III. Cons. Hon. 2</span></i>
			: aquilae, <i>ensigns</i>, <i>standards</i>, id. Nupt. Hon. et Mar.
			193.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: ista bellatrix iracundia, <i>this warlike rage</i>, * <i><span class="en">Cic. Tusc.
				4, 24, 54</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ira,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. in Rufin. 2, 118</span></i>
			.</div>
